       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-CLAY-GUILFORD.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-GUILFORD-PROOFS.
           05  WS-FLUENCY-NODE-COUNT-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-FLEXIBILITY-DUALITY-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ORIGINALITY-GROUP-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ELABORATION-DEPTH-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GUILFORD-SEAL-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-GUILFORD-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-GUILFORD-PROVEN      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-GUILFORD-CODE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-FLUENCY-AND-FLEXIBILITY.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-ORIGINALITY-AND-DEPTH.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-GUILFORD-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-FLUENCY-AND-FLEXIBILITY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FLUENCY-NODE-COUNT-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FLEXIBILITY-DUALITY-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-ORIGINALITY-AND-DEPTH.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ORIGINALITY-GROUP-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ELABORATION-DEPTH-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-GUILFORD-PROOFS.
           IF WS-FLUENCY-NODE-COUNT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-FLEXIBILITY-DUALITY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ORIGINALITY-GROUP-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ELABORATION-DEPTH-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-GUILFORD-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-GUILFORD-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-GUILFORD-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-GUILFORD-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-GUILFORD-CODE.
